        "attempts\"}},\"summary\":\"Find the account linked to a Google account\"}},\"/api/v1/account-backup/methods\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Returns {\\\"google_client_id\\\"} when the node has Google client IDs configured, otherwise an empty object.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Methods\"}},\"summary\":\"Show which optional sign-in methods this node offers\"}},\"/api/v1/account-backup/open\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {\\\"account\\\", \\\"proof\\\": 64 hex}. The node stores only SHA-256 of the proof and compares it in constant time. Returns {\\\"account_id\\\", \\\"backup\\\"}: the backup text sealed on the device with Argon2id, which the node cannot open. A wrong proof, an unknown name and an account without a backup all answer 403 {\\\"error\\\": \\\"wrong username or password\\\"}. Five wrong proofs are free; the fifth locks for 60 seconds and each further one doubles the lock, up to 24 hours. Locks are kept in the dat",
        "abase and survive a restart; a right proof clears them. While locked: 429 {\\\"error\\\": \\\"too many attempts\\\", \\\"retry_after\\\": seconds}. Limited to 20 requests a minute per address.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Backup released\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid account or proof\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Wrong username or password\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Too many attempts\"}},\"summary\":\"Release an account backup for a password's login proof\"}},\"/api/v1/account-backup/passkey/open\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {\\\"account\\\": 64-hex public ID, \\\"credential\\\": 64 hex SHA-256 of the credential ID, \\\"proof\\\": 64 hex}. The node stores only SHA-256 of the proof and compares it in constant time. Returns {\\\"account_id\\\", \\\"wrapper\\\"}: text sealed on the device under a key derived from the passkey's WebAuthn PRF output, which the node cannot open.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Copy releas",
        "ed\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid account, credential or proof\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Wrong or unknown passkey\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Too many attempts\"}},\"summary\":\"Release a passkey-sealed account copy for its login proof\"}},\"/api/v1/account-backup/salt\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {\\\"account\\\": username or 64-hex public ID}. Always answers {\\\"salt\\\": 32 hex}: the stored backup's salt, or a stable decoy when no backup is stored or nobody holds the name, so the answer does not tell which names keep a backup. Limited to 60 requests a minute per address.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Salt\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid account\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Rate limit exceeded\"}},\"summary\":\"Get the salt to derive an account backup's keys\"}},\"/api/v1/account/alias\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Normalizes alias, reports availability, current ownership, catego",
        "ry, price_units, units_per_dew and minimum/maximum length. Existing owners pay zero; a quote does not reserve the name. No-store.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"alias\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Username quote\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid alias\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Quote unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Quote a username claim\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Claims free usernames and retains the account's current username. On nodes with premium pricing, new premium claims require the explicit purchase endpoint and this endpoint never debits DEW.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer token from /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"Account ID matching the bearer.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-User\",\"re",
        "quired\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/AliasRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Alias stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid alias\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"},\"402\":{\"description\":\"Premium alias requires an explicit purchase\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Account not found\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Alias taken\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Alias unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Set account alias\"}},\"/api/v1/account/alias/purchase\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer and explicit confirmation of the current quote. A signed entity/username debit and the alias update commit together. Retry an uncertain paid claim with the same request_id, alias and price_units: it never charges twice. A retry after a later rename cannot restore the old name. Existing username",
        "s remain untouched and retaining the current name is free.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"alias\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"price_units\":{\"description\":\"Integer millionths of DEW from the quote\",\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"request_id\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":8,\"pattern\":\"^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]+$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"alias\",\"price_units\",\"request_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Claimed alias, price_units and optional signed receipt_id; no-store\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid input\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"402\":{\"description\":\"Insufficient DEW or premium price not confirmed\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Account not found\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Alias unavailable, price changed, or conflicting retry\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Purchase unavailab",
        "le; retain the request ID\"}},\"summary\":\"Buy an available premium username with DEW\"}},\"/api/v1/account/app-grants\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"App grants\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"List cross-app grants\"},\"post\":{\"responses\":{\"201\":{\"description\":\"Created app grant\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid or private collection\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Create cross-app grant\"}},\"/api/v1/account/app-grants/signed\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"The grant payload is bound to an X-Mesh-Tx-equivalent transaction signed by the account key and target app key.\",\"responses\":{\"201\":{\"description\":\"Created app grant\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Signed transaction rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Signed transaction replay\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Create cross-app grant with a signed transaction\"}},\"/api/v1/account/app-records\":{\"get\":{\"paramete",
        "rs\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"source_app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"target_app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"collection_prefix\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Encrypted records\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Grant required\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Read encrypted records from a granted app collection prefix\"}},\"/api/v1/account/backup\":{\"delete\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Returns {\\\"deleted\\\": bool}. Deleting the account also deletes its backup.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Backup deleted\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"}},\"summary\":\"Delete the signed-in account's backup\"},\"get\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Returns {\\\"stored\\\": bool, \\\"updated_at\\\": Unix seconds, 0 when none}.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Backup st",
        "atus\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"}},\"summary\":\"Show whether the signed-in account keeps a backup here\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Body: {\\\"backup\\\": waozi-account-backup-v3 text up to 17664 bytes, \\\"salt\\\": 32 hex, \\\"verifier\\\": 64 hex SHA-256 of the login proof}. The backup must use ML-DSA-44 and Argon2id with 65536 KiB, 3 passes and 1 lane, and its salt line must equal salt. Replaces any stored backup and clears its failed attempts. Not counted as account storage and not replicated to other nodes. Returns {\\\"stored\\\": true, \\\"updated_at\\\"}.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Backup stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid backup\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"}},\"summary\":\"Store the signed-in account's backup\"}},\"/api/v1/account/delete\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Deletes server-side mirrored data for the signed account without uploading the p",
        "rivate key. The account stops syncing, counting toward storage and appearing to others at once; its data is kept on hold for 30 days and then deleted permanently. Logging in again with restore set brings it back while it is on hold.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"SHA-256 hash of the ML-DSA-44 public key. Legacy X-Ksync-User and X-Inbe-User are also accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-User\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"ML-DSA-44 signature as hex or base64. Legacy X-Ksync-Signature and X-Inbe-Signature are also accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Signature\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/DeleteRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Remote data deleted\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid request or missi",
        "ng challenge\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Signature rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"Delete remote account data\"}},\"/api/v1/account/delete-with-key\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"For mesh-account-key-encrypted-v1 files, decrypt locally, get a fresh nonce from GET /api/v1/sync/challenge?user_id=\\u003cuser_id_hash\\u003e, and send the encrypted export with X-Mesh-Signature. Sign the mesh-sync-v1 message for POST /api/v1/account/delete-with-key using the exact JSON body and the nonce. Legacy plaintext exports remain supported. The account stops syncing and its data goes on hold for 30 days. Sign in with restore set to recover the account during the hold.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/DeleteWithKeyRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Remote data deleted\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid request or exported key\"},\"401\":{\"descripti",
        "on\":\"Signature or legacy key rejected\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Sync account not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Delete remote account using exported key\"}},\"/api/v1/account/devices\":{\"delete\":{\"description\":\"Revokes an Ed25519 installation key using a fresh ML-DSA account-signed request.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Device key revoked\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid revocation\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Revocation replay\"}},\"summary\":\"Revoke an account device key\"},\"get\":{\"description\":\"Lists per-installation Ed25519 keys registered by the authenticated account.\",\"parameters\":[{\"descript",
        "ion\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Registered device keys\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"List account device keys\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Registers a revocable Ed25519 installation key authorized by an ML-DSA account signature.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Device key registered\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid registration\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Registration replay\"}},\"summary\":\"Register an account de",
        "vice key\"}},\"/api/v1/account/export\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Bearer-authenticated read-only dump of all Mesh rows owned by or directly attached to the authenticated account. Clients generate account key exports locally.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Account data export\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Sync account not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Export authenticated account data\"}},\"/api/v1/account/google\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Returns {\\\"linked\\\": bool}.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Link status\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"}},\"summary\":\"Show whether a Google account is linked\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Body: {\\\"id_token\\\"}, with a non",
        "ce of the hex SHA-256 of \\\"waozi-google-link-v1\\\\n\\\" and the account's public ID. The node keeps only a keyed hash of Google's subject.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Linked\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Token not accepted\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Not configured\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Linked to another account\"}},\"summary\":\"Link a Google account to find the signed-in account\"}},\"/api/v1/account/google/remove\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Needs no Google token, so it also works after Google access was revoked.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Unlinked\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"}},\"summary\":\"Remove the Google link\"}},\"/api/v1/account/passkeys\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Returns {\\\"passkeys\\\": [{\\\"credential\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"created_at\\\"}]}, never the sealed copies.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Passkeys\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token ",
        "required\"}},\"summary\":\"List the signed-in account's passkeys\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Body: {\\\"credential\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"verifier\\\": 64 hex SHA-256 of the login proof, \\\"wrapper\\\": waozi-account-passkey-v1 text}. Up to 8 passkeys per account.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid copy\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Too many passkeys\"}},\"summary\":\"Store a passkey-sealed copy of the signed-in account\"}},\"/api/v1/account/passkeys/remove\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token. Body: {\\\"credential\\\"}. Returns {\\\"deleted\\\": bool}. Removal has no further conditions: the account's .key file is its master key.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Removed\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid credential\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token required\"}},\"summary\":\"Remove one of the signed-in account's passkey copi",
        "es\"}},\"/api/v1/account/profile-icon\":{\"post\":{\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ProfileIconRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Profile icon stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid icon\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"Set account profile icon\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/feedback\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires X-Mesh-Admin with the feedback token or the existing admin token. Disabled when neither is configured.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Up to 100 newest reports\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Operator authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Remote operator access disabled\"}},\"summary\":\"Private developer feedback in",
        "box\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/feedback/reply\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires X-Mesh-Admin and the account_id returned by the private inbox. Replies target exactly one account's report. Without reply_id, the reply is the report's single reply and replaces an earlier one. With a 64-character hexadecimal reply_id, it is added beside the report's earlier replies; retrying the same reply_id and reply changes nothing, and reusing a reply_id for another reply returns 409. The reporting account can read replies through GET /api/v1/feedback. Use replies=1 and a numeric offset to retrieve at most two replies per page, oldest first and without report diagnostics; each reply carries its own id (the report's ID for the single reply) and its report's title.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"account_id\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"minLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"maxLength",
        "\":64,\"minLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"},\"reply\":{\"maxLength\":4096,\"type\":\"string\"},\"reply_id\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"account_id\",\"id\",\"reply\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Report replied to\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid reply\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Operator authentication required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Report not found\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Reply ID already used for another reply\"}},\"summary\":\"Reply to an app feedback report\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/game-maps\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the configured X-Mesh-Admin token. Body: {game,source_version,maps:[{level,map_hash,map}]}. Accepts at most 512 maps and 1 MiB. Classic map_hash is SHA256 of shovey.classic.map.v1, LF, decimal level, LF, and the exact lowercase 1440-character cells+tiles+decorations encoding, with no trailing LF. Solutions are excluded. O",
        "ld revisions remain after map updates or package cleanup. Account clients cannot register maps.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Registered idempotently\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid map or hash\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Admin token required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Archive unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Register immutable approved map revisions\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/lumi/developer\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires a direct loopback request with the dedicated developer token in X-Mesh-Admin.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"The owner account and the next pending turn, if present\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Developer relay authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Direct loopback required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Developer chat unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the next developer turn for Harmony\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a direct loopback request with the dedicated developer token i",
        "n X-Mesh-Admin. Submit the account_id and id from the inbox with the reply. Repeating the same reply leaves the terminal turn unchanged.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"account_id\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reply\":{\"description\":\"Result, up to 8192 UTF-8 bytes\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"account_id\",\"id\",\"reply\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Reply stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid reply\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Developer relay authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Direct loopback required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Turn is unavailable or already has a different reply\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Developer chat unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Save Harmony's result for a developer turn\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/tokens/checkpoint\":{\"post\":{\"",
        "responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token checkpoint\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid admin token\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Admin disabled\"}},\"summary\":\"Create signed token checkpoint\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/tokens/manual-credit\":{\"post\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed credit receipt\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid admin token\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Admin disabled\"}},\"summary\":\"Admin credit tokens\"}},\"/api/v1/admin/tokens/purchases/telegram/reconcile\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the configured admin header or direct loopback operator access. JSON body with nonnegative offset. Up to 32 entries per call.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Seen and matched counts and next_offset\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Provider or wallet temporarily unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Reconcile one authenticated Telegram Stars transaction page\"}},\"/api/v1/apps\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"appli",
        "cation/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/AppRegistryResponse\"}}},\"description\":\"App registry\"}},\"summary\":\"List registered apps\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the server admin token and matching X-Mesh-Admin header. X-Ksync-Admin remains accepted for compatibility.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/AppRegistration\"}}},\"description\":\"Registered app\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid admin token\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Admin registration disabled\"}},\"summary\":\"Register or update an app\"}},\"/api/v1/apps/register-signed\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"The manifest is signed by an active Ed25519 app key and approved by the node registry key configured on this node.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/AppRegistration\"}}},\"description\":\"Registered app\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"",
        "Manifest or node approval signature rejected\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Node registry approval key unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Register or update an app with a signed manifest\"}},\"/api/v1/apps/{app_id}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/AppRegistration\"}}},\"description\":\"App registration\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"App not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Get registered app\"},\"put\":{\"description\":\"Requires the server admin token and matching X-Mesh-Admin header. X-Ksync-Admin remains accepted for compatibility.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/AppRegistration\"}}},\"description\":\"Registered app\"}},\"summary\":\"Regist",
        "er or update an app\"}},\"/api/v1/apps/{app_id}/collections\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Collection prefixes\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"App not found\"}},\"summary\":\"List app collection prefixes\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/approve\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Owner ML-DSA signature binds account, grant, claimed delegate Ed25519 and ML-KEM-768 keys, registered app/client, node/audience, exact collection, approved visibility, read/write operations, key generation, opaque encrypted collection-key envelope, timestamps, nonce and optional verified Telegram identity. An explicit telegram_stars flag authorizes only the Telegram Stars purchase routes and Dew balance read for that linked buyer. Maximum lifetime is thirty days. Known Inbe private v1 collections sharing the global key are refused. No chain",
        "ing, broad bearer, account export/delete or unlisted operations.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed grant accepted\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Owner grant signature rejected\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Scope or current app policy mismatch\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Does not match claimed request or already issued\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Owner signs one finite delegate grant\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/cancel\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires an owner protocol-v6 signed request. A cancelled rendezvous cannot be claimed or approved.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Cancelled\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Owner signatures required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Already completed or unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Owner cancels a pending or claimed rendezvous\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/challenge\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Grant ID is public metadata. Active gr",
        "ant, current app policy and issuing node are rechecked. A challenge alone grants no access.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Fresh key-proof challenge\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Expired, revoked or unavailable on this node\"}},\"summary\":\"Request a fresh ninety-second session challenge\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/claim\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Ed25519 proof binds the full rendezvous and both public keys. Telegram claims require raw server-validated production initData for the bound bot and numeric sender; initData is one-use, five-minute maximum age and never accepted from the future. Chat linking alone does not authorize this session.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Delegate claimed; owner approval still required\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Key or Telegram proof rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, cancelled, conflicting or replayed claim\"}},\"summary\":\"Delegate proves its separate ",
        "signing and encryption public keys\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/rendezvous\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Unauthenticated holders receive only request/grant IDs, app, node/audience, expiry, fresh challenge and status. Full account, numeric Telegram identity, scopes and claimed keys require the matching owner bearer. Never returns a session credential or private key. Issuing-node-only.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Pairing status\"},\"410\":{\"description\":\"Wrong node, missing or expired rendezvous\"}},\"summary\":\"Read an expiring rendezvous by ID\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/requests\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the owner bearer and unchanged protocol-v6 ML-DSA/device transaction signature. Exact registered collection read/write scopes only. Telegram requests bind the existing numeric chat connection. URLs may carry the expiring rendezvous ID only.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Pendin",
        "g rendezvous and proof challenge\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Owner signatures required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Telegram chat must be linked\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Owner initiates a ten-minute delegate rendezvous\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/revoke\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires an owner protocol-v6 signed request. Revocation is checked on every request and socket notification. Previously received plaintext cannot be erased. Telegram disconnect also revokes its grants.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Revoked\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Owner signatures required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Owned grant not found\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Owner revokes future delegate access and renewal\"}},\"/api/v1/authorization/session\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Ed25519 proof consumes the fresh challenge atomically. Returns the signed grant, public owner key, opaque approv",
        "ed collection-key envelopes and a key-bound credential; the credential is never accepted by broad BearerUser. Renewal requires another fresh challenge and proof.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Key-bound short session\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Wrong key or inactive grant\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired or reused challenge\"}},\"summary\":\"Exchange a one-use delegate-key proof for a five-minute session\"}},\"/api/v1/blobs/{app_id}/{sha256}\":{\"delete\":{\"description\":\"Bearer and account/device transaction signatures are required. The blob stops counting toward the account's storage. Deleting a missing blob also succeeds.\",\"responses\":{\"204\":{\"description\":\"Deleted\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Missing or invalid authorization\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"App inactive\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Replay rejected\"},\"507\":{\"description\":\"Storage unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Delete",
        " an account-private blob the account no longer references\"},\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/octet-stream\":{\"schema\":{\"format\":\"binary\",\"type\":\"string\"}}},\"description\":\"Integrity-checked ciphertext\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Authorization required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"No blob in this account/app\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Integrity check failed\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Read account-private encrypted bytes\"},\"head\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Blob available\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Authorization required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Blob unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Check an account-private ciphertext blob before resuming upload\"},\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"sha256\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\"",
        ":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Tx\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"put\":{\"description\":\"Bearer and account/device transaction signatures are required. Body SHA-256 must equal the path. Maximum 16 MiB. Blobs are scoped to account and active app; they are excluded from mesh replication.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/octet-stream\":{\"schema\":{\"format\":\"binary\",\"type\":\"string\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"204\":{\"description\":\"Stored atomically\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid address or hash\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Missing or invalid authorization\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"App inactive\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Replay rejected\"},\"413\":{\"description\":\"Empty or oversized blob\"},\"507\":{\"description\":\"Storage unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Store immutable private encrypted bytes on this node\"}},\"/api/v1/blobs/{app_id}/{sha256}/restore\":{\"parameters\"",
        ":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"sha256\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Tx\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer and account/device transaction signatures are required, with an empty body. The blob counts toward the account's storage again, so a full account is refused with storage_full. Restoring a blob that is not in the trash also succeeds.\",\"responses\":{\"204\":{\"description\":\"Restored\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Missing or invalid authorization\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"App inactive\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"No blob in this account/app\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Replay rejected\"},\"413\":{\"description\":\"Account storage full\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Take an account-private blob out of the trash\"}},\"/api/v1/",
        "blobs/{app_id}/{sha256}/trash\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"sha256\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Tx\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer and account/device transaction signatures are required, with an empty body. A trashed blob stays readable but stops counting toward the account's storage at once. The node deletes it after its trash period, 30 days after it was first trashed by default, unless it is restored or stored again. Trashing a blob already in the trash also succeeds.\",\"responses\":{\"204\":{\"description\":\"In the trash\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Missing or invalid authorization\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"App inactive\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"No blob in this account/app\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Repl",
        "ay rejected\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Move an account-private blob to the trash\"}},\"/api/v1/chat/completions\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a Mesh bearer token and X-Mesh-User. The node keeps the provider key private, bounds context and output, and enforces persistent daily account and node limits. Each model request, including tool continuations and failed provider attempts, uses one allowance unit. Tools execute only in the client harness. A disabled or unavailable provider returns 503; exhausted allowances return 429.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"context\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"messages\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":20,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"},\"tools\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":64,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"messages\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Assist",
        "ant message or tool calls, and remaining allowance\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed or oversized context\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Daily allowance exhausted\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Online chat unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Account-limited online app conversation\"}},\"/api/v1/chat/habit-icons\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a Mesh bearer token and X-Mesh-User. Chooses, for each habit in order, one of the offered icon names that obviously fits it, or an empty string when none clearly fits. Offer 1 to 64 distinct icon names of 1 to 32 lowercase letters, digits or underscores, and 1 to 32 habits with a non-blank name of up to 64 bytes and an optional description of up to 256 bytes. Habits and answers are not stored. Each request uses one unit of the same daily account and node allowance as online chat. A d",
        "isabled or unavailable provider or an unusable model answer returns 503; exhausted allowances return 429.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"habits\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"description\":{\"maxLength\":256,\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"name\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":32,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"},\"icons\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^[a-z0-9_]{1,32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":64,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true}},\"required\":[\"icons\",\"habits\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"One icon name or empty string per habit, in order, and remaining allowance\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid icon names or habits\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Daily allowance exhausted\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Online chat unavailable or inv",
        "alid model response\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Account-limited habit icon choice\"}},\"/api/v1/chat/spelling\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a Mesh bearer token and X-Mesh-User. Corrects only misspelled words in one text of up to 8192 bytes and returns the whole text with its surrounding blank space unchanged. The text is not stored. Each request uses one unit of the same daily account and node allowance as online chat. A disabled or unavailable provider returns 503; exhausted allowances return 429.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"maxLength\":8192,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Corrected text and remaining allowance\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Empty or oversized text\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"D",
        "aily allowance exhausted\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Online chat unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Account-limited spelling correction\"}},\"/api/v1/delegated/sync\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Authorization: Delegate ds1.\\u003csession-id\\u003e plus X-Mesh-Delegate Ed25519 proof. Proof binds grant/session/account/app/client/node/audience/challenge, method, normalized path/query, body SHA-256, expiry and unique nonce. Replay claim and mutations commit together. Scoped validation reuses sync v6. Reads, cursors and truncation filter key_id; delegates cannot overwrite records rotated to another key. No full snapshots, plaintext data, deletion or extra routes. This custom proof protocol is not OAuth DPoP. Other nodes and partitions fail closed.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Scoped records and cursor\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid proof or inactive session/grant\"},\"403\":",
        "{\"description\":\"Operation, collection, app policy or key generation outside scope\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Request replayed\"}},\"summary\":\"Read or write one exact approved encrypted collection/key generation\"}},\"/api/v1/delegated/ws\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Fresh signed GET proof with normalized collection query is consumed atomically. Browser credentials are supplied in mesh.delegate.\\u003cbase64url-proof\\u003e and mesh.session.\\u003csession-id\\u003e subprotocols, never URLs. Events expose only the approved collection generation's version; grants, app policy, node and session expiry are checked before notifications. Revocation closes the socket.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"collection\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"101\":{\"description\":\"Scoped socket\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Key proof or active session required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Collection outsi",
        "de grant\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Handshake proof replayed\"}},\"summary\":\"Observe one approved collection/key generation\"}},\"/api/v1/feedback\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Up to 100 reports with replies\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Feedback service unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Read the account's reports and developer replies\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Idempotent by account and 64-character report ID. Up to 20 reports per account per UTC day. Feedback contains only the authored report and bounded app diagnostics, and is private to its account and node operator.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"app_id\":{\"const\":\"inbe\"},\"context\":{\"maxLength\":2048,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"minLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"},\"message\":{\"maxLength\":4096,\"type\":\"string\"},",
        "\"title\":{\"maxLength\":160,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"app_id\",\"title\",\"message\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Saved report ID\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid feedback\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Daily report allowance exhausted\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Feedback service unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Deliver an account's app feedback\"}},\"/api/v1/friends\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Bearer-authenticated. Returns account-level Mesh friends.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Friends list\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"List accepted friends\"}},\"/api/v1/friends/requests\":{\"ge",
        "t\":{\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Incoming and outgoing requests\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"List pending friend requests\"},\"post\":{\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/FriendRequestCreateRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"201\":{\"description\":\"Friend request created\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Target account not found\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Already friends or self-request\"}},\"summary\":\"Create friend request\"}},\"/api/v1/friends/requests/{request_id}/accept\":{\"post\":{",
        "\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Request accepted\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Request not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Accept friend request\"}},\"/api/v1/friends/requests/{request_id}/decline\":{\"post\":{\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Request declined\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Request not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Decline friend request\"}},\"/api/v1/friends/stats\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Returns the caller and accepted friends only.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token re",
        "turned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"app\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"practice\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"metric\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Leaderboard rows\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid stats query\"}},\"summary\":\"List friend leaderboard stats\"}},\"/api/v1/game-completions\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires game, level and map_hash query fields; optional nonnegative offset. Returns completions, map and next_offset, ordered by fewest actual moves, 16 attempts per page. Account bearer required; another account's history is never returned. Incomplete legacy evidence remains non-eligible history.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Own-account history; private",
        ", no-store\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid history query\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account bearer required\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the account's completion history and exact played map\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {game,level,map_hash,moves,actions,trace,evidence_complete}. Limit 1 MiB, 60000 accepted actions and 120000 visited cells. Actual engine moves are separate from actions and traced cells. Trace uses two lowercase hex digits per cell, includes slide cells and paired portal entrance/exit. Validates the registered exact map, unconditional solids, start/end and adjacency or exact portal pair; does not replay the puzzle engine. Repeated identical submissions are idempotent. Retains all attempts so a sub10 shortest route or incomplete legacy attempt cannot hide qualifying evidence. No per-move requests.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Stored with id and created flag; private, no-st",
        "ore\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid evidence or unregistered map\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account bearer required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Archive unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Sync one completed attempt for the authenticated account\"}},\"/api/v1/link/close\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {\\\"id\\\"}. Either device closes the link once it is connected or cancelled.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Link removed\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid link\"}},\"summary\":\"Forget a device link\"}},\"/api/v1/link/get\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {\\\"id\\\", \\\"slot\\\"}. Returns {\\\"data\\\"} once the other device has written the slot.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Sealed message\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Waiting for the other device, or the link expired\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Rate limit exceeded\"}},\"summary\":\"Read a device link slot\"}},\"/api/v1/link/put\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body: {\\\"id\\\": 32 lowercase he",
        "x link ID shown in a QR code, \\\"slot\\\": \\\"request\\\" or \\\"response\\\", \\\"data\\\": sealed text up to 16384 bytes}. Each slot is written once. Links expire ten minutes after their first message. Messages are sealed between the two devices; the node relays them without reading them.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Message stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid link, slot or message\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Slot already written\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Rate limit exceeded\"}},\"summary\":\"Send one sealed message through a device link\"}},\"/api/v1/lists\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer and X-Mesh-User. Pending recipients see invitation metadata only. List contents are stored on this node. Lists notifications are scoped to the Lists app.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Account-scoped lists and invitations arrays; deleted owner lists are tombstones\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"",
        "Account authentication required\"}},\"summary\":\"Read accepted shared lists and list invitations\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Commands use a stable request_id (at most 36 characters) and action invite, accept, decline, save or delete. Repeating the same request returns its current snapshot; reusing its ID for a different body is rejected. Invite sends target and list {id,title,items:[{id,title,comment,done}]}. Accept/decline sends invitation_id; only its target may answer a pending invitation. Save sends list with its current revision. Accepted friends can edit items; owners alone rename, delete and invite. Up to 32 active shared lists and 256 shared items per account. Errors retain the existing list.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"invite\",\"accept\",\"decline\",\"save\",\"delete\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"invitation_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"list\":",
        "{\"type\":\"object\"},\"request_id\":{\"maxLength\":36,\"type\":\"string\"},\"target\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"request_id\",\"action\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Confirmed command and fresh account-scoped snapshot\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed or oversized command\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Friendship or owner permission required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"List or invitation is inaccessible\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Stale revision, capacity reached, answered invitation or mismatched retry\"}},\"summary\":\"Invite a friend, answer an invitation or update a shared list\"}},\"/api/v1/lumi/developer\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a signed Mesh account session for the configured Lumi owner. Supply text to submit a turn. Omit text to read its result. Repeating the same ID and text retrieves the existing tu",
        "rn for seven days.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"text\":{\"description\":\"Prompt, up to 8192 UTF-8 bytes\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"The turn ID and its reply once available\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid turn\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Owner account required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Unknown turn\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Turn ID is already used for different text\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Developer queue is full\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Developer chat unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Submit or read a turn in the owner's developer chat\"}},\"/api/v1/lumi/telegram/ack\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"An optional reply sends the final answer to the originatin",
        "g private Telegram message once. It requires the original account and claiming client. A 202 acknowledgement records that delivery could not be confirmed and prevents automatic replay.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Acknowledged. Any requested reply has a delivery receipt\"},\"202\":{\"description\":\"Acknowledged. Telegram delivery is unconfirmed\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid receipt\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Sign in required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"No matching private Telegram message claim\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Acknowledge an action claimed by this app client\"}},\"/api/v1/lumi/telegram/link\":{\"delete\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Disconnected\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Sign in required\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Disconnect the account's Telegram chat\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Authenticated account only. The link expires after ten minutes. ",
        "Account signing keys stay in the app.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Bot deep link\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Sign in required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Bot unavailable\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Create a one-use Lumi Telegram account link\"}},\"/api/v1/lumi/telegram/messages\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Authenticated history uploads from older apps drain silently, including stale history and previous uncertain deliveries. Conversation history remains in encrypted account sync. No Telegram text, actions or notifications are sent.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Acknowledged without external delivery\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid upload\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Sign in required\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Acknowledge a legacy Lumi conversation upload without sending to Telegram\"}},\"/api/v1/lumi/telegram/updates\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires a stabl",
        "e 64-character app client identifier. Each update belongs to one executor. Owner feedback is restricted to the configured immutable account ID.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"client\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"minLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Link status and next claimed update\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid client\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Sign in required\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Claim the next app action or owner feedback message\"}},\"/api/v1/lumi/telegram/webhook\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token. Only numeric sender identities in their own private chats are accepted. Duplicate update IDs cannot execute a second action.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Accepted or ignored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid update\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Webhook authentication required\"}},\"sum",
        "mary\":\"Accept private-chat updates from the dedicated Lumi bot\"}},\"/api/v1/namespaces\":{\"post\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"New trust space\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Operator authorization required\"}},\"summary\":\"Create a local trust-space naming authority\"}},\"/api/v1/namespaces/claims\":{\"post\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed name claim\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Operator authorization required\"}},\"summary\":\"Sign or update a trust-space name claim\"}},\"/api/v1/namespaces/resolve\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Accepts space_id and name query parameters. Trust spaces are local views and do not replace public DNS.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed service claim\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Name not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Resolve a signed trust-space name\"}},\"/api/v1/node\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/NodeInfoRespo",
        "nse\"}}},\"description\":\"Node protocol bounds, capabilities, known peer nodes, and aggregate usage counts\"}},\"summary\":\"Node metadata\"}},\"/api/v1/node/mesh/export\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a signed paired-node request or the migration node token. The response is filtered by the requested and paired sync policies.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Policy-filtered app manifests, encrypted records, tombstones, and names\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid node token\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Node sync is not configured\"}},\"summary\":\"Export approved mesh data to a trusted peer node\"}},\"/api/v1/node/mesh/import\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires a signed paired-node request or the migration node token. Incoming objects are signature-checked, scope-checked, and applied idempotently.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Import result\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid record payload\"},\"401\":{\"",
        "description\":\"Invalid node token\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Node sync is not configured\"}},\"summary\":\"Import approved mesh data from a trusted peer node\"}},\"/api/v1/node/pairing/accept\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Operator-only. Verifies the invite, pins the peer key and policy, and rejects expired or reused invites.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Trusted peer\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid or expired invite\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Invite already consumed\"}},\"summary\":\"Accept a signed node-pairing invite\"}},\"/api/v1/node/pairing/complete\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Verifies a signed acceptance against a locally issued, single-use invite and stores the accepting peer with the inverse directional policy.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Reciprocal peer trust established\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid invite or acceptance signature\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Invite missing, expired, or alr",
        "eady claimed\"}},\"summary\":\"Complete reciprocal node pairing\"}},\"/api/v1/node/pairing/invites\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Operator-only. The invite contains the node identity, addresses, expiry, and explicit replication policy.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed pairing invite\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Operator authorization required\"}},\"summary\":\"Create a signed node-pairing invite\"}},\"/api/v1/node/peers\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Trusted peers and their approved scopes\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Operator authorization required\"}},\"summary\":\"List paired peer nodes\"}},\"/api/v1/packages/{app_id}/{asset}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"latest or the release SHA-256 followed by .zib\",\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Sig",
        "ned release metadata or the portable bundle\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"The artifact is gated; v2 serves it with a grant\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"App or release is unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read an app's desktop portable release\"}},\"/api/v1/profile/stats\":{\"put\":{\"description\":\"Bearer-authenticated aggregate stats. Mesh stores only app/practice/metric/value rows.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ProfileStatsRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Stats stored\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid stat namespace\"}},\"summary\":\"Publish app-neutral profile stats\"}},\"/api/v1/publications\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Without author, lis",
        "ts the newest public publications. With author (alias, @alias or 64-hex public ID), lists that author's publications the caller may see: public ones, friends-only ones when the caller is the author's friend, and private ones only for the author; an unknown author has none. format keeps one document format. Newest updated first, at most 50. Each publication is {id, author {alias, public_id}, format, title, levels, visibility, updated_at, mine}. Limited to 120 reads a minute per account.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"format\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[a-z0-9.-]{1,64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"author\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"publications array; no-store\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid format\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Too many reads\"}},\"summar",
        "y\":\"Find published level collections\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. document is an opaque JSON object of at most 262144 bytes; levels counts its top-level levels array. visibility is public, friends (the author's friends) or private (the author alone). Without id this creates a publication with a new id; with id it replaces the format, title, visibility and document of the caller's own publication, and anyone else's answers 404. An account keeps at most 100 publications, and documents count toward its storage. Publishing and unpublishing are limited to 60 an hour per account.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"document\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"format\":{\"pattern\":\"^[a-z0-9.-]{1,64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"1 to 80 bytes of UTF-8 without control characters\",\"type\":",
        "\"string\"},\"visibility\":{\"enum\":[\"public\",\"friends\",\"private\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"format\",\"title\",\"visibility\",\"document\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"The publication's metadata; no-store\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid format, title, visibility or document\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"No publication of the caller's has this id\"},\"413\":{\"description\":\"Document too large, 100 publications already, or the account storage limit reached (code storage_full)\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Too many publishing changes\"}},\"summary\":\"Publish or replace a level collection\"}},\"/api/v1/publications/{id}\":{\"delete\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Only the author may delete a publication; anyone else's and missing ids answer 404.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"id\",\"required\":true,\"sch",
        "ema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"deleted true; no-store\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"No publication of the caller's has this id\"},\"429\":{\"description\":\"Too many publishing changes\"}},\"summary\":\"Unpublish a publication\"},\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Returns {publication, document} when the caller may see it under its visibility; otherwise 404, so a publication's existence never leaks. Limited to 120 reads a minute per account.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Publication metadata and the stored document; no-store\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Missing or not visible to the caller\"},\"429\":{\"descriptio",
        "n\":\"Too many reads\"}},\"summary\":\"Fetch a publication and its document\"}},\"/api/v1/rates\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Public. Returns xmr_usd_cents (integer US cents per XMR), updated_at (Unix seconds), sources (the agreeing source names), and the node's fixed Dew funding ratio xmr_atomic_units per token_units (0 when unset). The node refreshes the USD rate every ten minutes from several public sources and keeps the median of at least two that agree within 10%. Without a rate newer than two hours, xmr_usd_cents and updated_at are 0 and sources is empty. The USD rate is for display only: it never sets a price, a charge or a Dew credit.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Current display rate; cacheable for five minutes\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the node's XMR/USD display rate and Dew funding ratio\"}},\"/api/v1/referrals/accepted\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Bearer account's accepted friends including no",
        "npurchasers. Immutable increasing acceptance sequence; default50,max100. Each row: account_id,display_name,alias,accepted_at,cursor. Public ID fallback after alias loss/account deletion. next_cursor decimal string or empty at end. No private payment history. Private no-store.\",\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"cursor\",\"schema\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"limit\",\"schema\":{\"default\":50,\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"accepted array and next_cursor\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"invalid_request\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"wrong_node\"}},\"summary\":\"List everyone who accepted your code\"}},\"/api/v1/referrals/claim\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"The signed account becomes permanently bound to at most one referrer at the canonical issuer. Atomically records acceptance and issues",
        "20000000 units, with no purchase, minimum spend, expiry or hold. Public alias/account ID and acceptance date become visible to inviter. Same account/code retries return original receipt. A different code cannot replace a referrer. source_app_id is attribution only, never proof of store origin.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"code\":{\"maxLength\":32,\"minLength\":32,\"type\":\"string\"},\"request_id\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":8,\"type\":\"string\"},\"source_app_id\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"code\",\"request_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"bound or already_bound; referrer_id,accepted_at,welcome_units,welcome_receipt_id\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"invalid_request\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"invalid_code\"},\"409\":{\"descrip",
        "tion\":\"revoked_code,self_referral,already_bound,request_conflict or wrong_node\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"unavailable; retry same request\"}},\"summary\":\"Accept a referral and immediately receive20 Dew\"}},\"/api/v1/referrals/code/rotate\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Revokes previous code for new claims. Existing relationships/list/rewards persist. Account/request idempotent.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"request_id\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":8,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"request_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"code,invite_url\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"invalid_request\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"wrong_node\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Rotate your invitation code\"}},\"/api/v1/referrals/me\":{\"get\":{\"descriptio",
        "n\":\"Existing signed-account Bearer required. Durable unlimited-invite code and share URL, permanent referrer binding, acceptance date, welcome receipt, accepted_count, earned_units, reversed_units and pending_offset_units. Integer millionths. Earnings include every direct friend's verified paid Dew purchase at floor(net paid units/20), without expiry. No individual friend purchase history. Private no-store.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"status,authority,account_id,code,invite_url,referrer_id,accepted_at,welcome_receipt_id,accepted_count,earned_units,reversed_units,pending_offset_units\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"wrong_node with canonical authority\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Issuer unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read your canonical Waozi referral program\"}},\"/api/v1/rewards\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Returns r",
        "ewards [{reward,units}]: the Dew the next claim of each reward gives, in integer millionths.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"The rewards and their Dew; no-store\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"}},\"summary\":\"List the game rewards the node gives\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"The node sets each reward's Dew; the client names only the reward. Requires complete synced evidence with at least 10 moves for Classic 1-28 (chest) or 1-175 (campaign), or earned progress imported once from the immutable pre-upgrade account snapshot. New uploads cannot enlarge legacy eligibility. The campaign pays by finishing place: 100 Dew for places 1-10, 50 for 11-30, 20 for 31-100 and 5 after. Wurm's daily rewards wurm.daily-05, -10, -15, -20 and -25 give 1, 2, 2, 2 and 3 Dew once the node has counted 5, 10, 15, 20 or 25 consecutive UTC check-in days for the account, ending today, and a",
        " missed day starts the count over; every claim of one checks the account in for that day, also when it answers 403. Returns {reward,units,credited,balance}, with place for the campaign; each account is credited once and keeps its place.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"reward\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"reward\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Claimed, or claimed before, with the current balance\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed request\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Required qualifying completion evidence has not synced, or too few consecutive check-in days\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Unknown reward\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Rewards unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Claim a game reward for the account\"}},\"/api/v1/rewards/migration\":{\"get\":{\"description",
        "\":\"Bearer authenticated, private no-store. Returns status missing/done/available. Available includes the frozen ciphertext, its SHA-256 snapshot ID and 24-byte nonce_hex. Only the canonical pre-upgrade Shovey Classic record is eligible.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Frozen snapshot or migration state\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Authentication required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Snapshot unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the account frozen legacy progress snapshot\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Bearer authenticated. Body {snapshot,key} identifies the frozen version and its 32-byte nonce-prefix HChaCha20 opening subkey in hex. Never submit an account key or reusable record key. The node authenticates the exact old record, stores earned unlocks/completion marks and discards opening material. No Dew is credited; use the normal claim endpoint.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\"",
        ":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"key\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"minLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"},\"snapshot\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"minLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"snapshot\",\"key\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Migrated or already migrated\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed body\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"No matching frozen record or invalid proof\"}},\"summary\":\"Import earned legacy progress once\"}},\"/api/v1/storage/plan\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Returns account_id, asset_id, enabled, used_bytes, free_bytes (the node's free allowance, MESH_ACCOUNT_STORAGE_LIMIT_BYTES; 0 means unlimited), units_per_dew (1000000), plans [{size,limit_bytes,monthly_units,yearly_units,monthly_xmr_atomic_units,yearly_xmr_atomic_units}] for size 1gb (1073741824 bytes; 20 Dew a month, 200 De",
        "w a year) and 5gb (5368709120 bytes; 60 Dew a month, 600 Dew a year), and plan {period,size,expires_at,limit_bytes,balance}. The top-level monthly_units, yearly_units, monthly_xmr_atomic_units and yearly_xmr_atomic_units repeat the 1gb plan for older apps. Balance and prices are integer millionths of Dew. XMR prices use integer atomic units (1 XMR = 1000000000000 atomic units), derived from the fixed node funding ratio, rounded up to fund the complete purchase. No fiat prices or external exchange-rate feed are used. Missing or unrepresentable XMR prices disable upgrades. The enabled node grants free_bytes free, or the plan size until expires_at. Expiry blocks growth while preserving reads and deletions.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Account-scoped Dew balance and storage allowance; no-store\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Storage ",
        "balance unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read Dew balance and prepaid storage allowance\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Explicit prepaid purchase of a plan from GET: 1gb costs 20 Dew a month or 200 Dew a year, 5gb costs 60 Dew a month or 600 Dew a year. A missing size means 1gb. Display the plan's Dew price returned by GET before purchase. A configured fixed XMR funding ratio is required. The same size extends unexpired time or starts now; another size starts now with the unexpired time converted at the monthly price ratio (remaining x old / new, rounded down). Does not auto-renew. The debit and allowance commit atomically. Preserve request_id on uncertain results: repeating it never charges or extends twice; changing the period or size for the same ID is rejected. Monero funding uses the existing account subaddress and confirmed deposit reconciliation.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json",
        "\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"period\":{\"enum\":[\"monthly\",\"yearly\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"request_id\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"type\":\"string\"},\"size\":{\"default\":\"1gb\",\"enum\":[\"1gb\",\"5gb\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"period\",\"request_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Confirmed upgrade and current balance\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid period, size or request ID\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"402\":{\"description\":\"Not enough Dew\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Request ID reused for another period or size\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Upgrades disabled or unavailable; retain the request ID\"}},\"summary\":\"Buy one month or one year of 1 GB or 5 GB storage with Dew\"}},\"/api/v1/sync\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Applies typed sync changes for existing clients. Protocol v6 requires app_id plus X-Mesh-Tx. If the JSON body has v, nonce, and ciphertext fie",
        "lds, Mesh stores and relays it as an opaque encrypted envelope authenticated by bearer token.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"SHA-256 hash of the ML-DSA-44 public key. Legacy X-Ksync-User and X-Inbe-User are also accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-User\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"Optional client ID for encrypted envelope metadata. X-Ksync-Client remains accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Client\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"Optional last-seen server version for encrypted envelope delta reads. X-Ksync-Since-Version remains accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Since-Version\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"description",
        "\":\"Optional encrypted envelope page size. X-Ksync-Limit remains accepted. The server may clamp this with MESH_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_MAX_RETURN.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Limit\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/SyncRequest\"},{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/EncryptedSyncEnvelope\"}]}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/SyncResponse\"}}},\"description\":\"Changes applied\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid request or missing challenge\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"Apply sync changes\"}},\"/api/v1/sync/challenge\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"user_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Challenge nonce\"},\"400",
        "\":{\"description\":\"Invalid user id\"}},\"summary\":\"Issue sync challenge\"}},\"/api/v1/sync/diagnostics\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/SyncDiagnosticReport\"}}},\"description\":\"Sync diagnostic report\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid bearer token\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Inspect sync state for the authenticated account\"}},\"/api/v1/sync/login\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Body is signed through X-Mesh-Signature over the exact raw request body bytes. Legacy X-Ksync-Signature and X-Inbe-Signature headers remain accepted. The response includes server_time for client token-expiry clock skew compensation.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"SHA-256 hash of the ML-DSA-44 public key. Legacy X-Ksync-User and X-Inbe-User are also accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-User\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\"",
        ",\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"ML-DSA-44 signature as hex or base64. Legacy X-Ksync-Signature and X-Inbe-Signature are also accepted.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"X-Mesh-Signature\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/LoginRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/LoginResponse\"}}},\"description\":\"Bearer token issued\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid request or missing challenge\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Signature rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"Create bearer token\"}},\"/api/v1/sync/logout\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Revokes the authenticated bearer session and disconnects its active sync sockets. Future requests require a fresh login.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"",
        "name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Bearer session revoked\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer session is missing, expired or revoked\"}},\"summary\":\"Revoke current bearer session\"}},\"/api/v1/sync/ws\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"WebSocket endpoint. Send Authorization: Bearer \\u003cauth_token\\u003e. Browser clients may use Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: mesh-sync-v1, bearer.\\u003cauth_token\\u003e. Legacy daochi-sync-v1, ksync-sync-v1 and inbe-sync-v1 remain accepted. The server emits sync_ready after connect and sync_changed whenever another client applies changes.\",\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"Bearer auth token returned by POST /api/v1/sync/login.\",\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"101\":{\"description\":\"WebSocket upgrade accepted\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid websocket hands",
        "hake\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Bearer token rejected\"}},\"summary\":\"Subscribe to sync change events\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/account/bind\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Entries expire after ten minutes. Telegram identity is verified server-side; no owner private key or recovery passphrase is accepted. Status, cancel and bind require fresh one-use key proofs. Bind additionally requires an existing owner bearer and unchanged v6 owner/device transaction signatures.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Verified result\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed proof\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Identity or signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, conflicting, or replayed entry\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Bind a locally created or restored owner account to the verified Telegram entry\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/entry\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Entries expire a",
        "fter ten minutes. Telegram identity is verified server-side; no owner private key or recovery passphrase is accepted. Status, cancel and bind require fresh one-use key proofs. Bind additionally requires an existing owner bearer and unchanged v6 owner/device transaction signatures.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Verified result\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed proof\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Identity or signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, conflicting, or replayed entry\"}},\"summary\":\"Read an expiring bot entry challenge\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/entry/cancel\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Entries expire after ten minutes. Telegram identity is verified server-side; no owner private key or recovery passphrase is accepted. Status, cancel and bind require fresh one-use key proofs. Bind additionally requires an existing owner bearer and unchanged v6 owner/device ",
        "transaction signatures.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Verified result\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed proof\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Identity or signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, conflicting, or replayed entry\"}},\"summary\":\"Cancel a verified entry with a fresh delegate proof\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/entry/rendezvous\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Requires the same verified numeric Telegram sender and delegate signing/encryption keys as the expiring bot entry. Each proof is bound to the entry, action, node, audience, expiry and one-use nonce. URL possession alone cannot poll. The response contains only expiring authorization rendezvous metadata; account identity, numeric sender, private keys and recovery data are never returned. This discovery does not approve a grant.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Minimal matching owner authorization rendezvous",
        "\"},\"202\":{\"description\":\"Verified entry is waiting for an owner authorization request\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed entry action\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Verified delegate proof rejected or expired\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Entry unavailable\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Proof replayed or current account binding conflicts\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Entry or owner request unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Discover an owner authorization request using a fresh verified delegate proof\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/entry/status\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Entries expire after ten minutes. Telegram identity is verified server-side; no owner private key or recovery passphrase is accepted. Status, cancel and bind require fresh one-use key proofs. Bind additionally requires an existing owner bearer and unchanged v6 owner/device transaction signatures.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Verified resul",
        "t\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed proof\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Identity or signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, conflicting, or replayed entry\"}},\"summary\":\"Read verified entry status using a fresh delegate proof\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/entry/verify\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Entries expire after ten minutes. Telegram identity is verified server-side; no owner private key or recovery passphrase is accepted. Status, cancel and bind require fresh one-use key proofs. Bind additionally requires an existing owner bearer and unchanged v6 owner/device transaction signatures.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Verified result\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed proof\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Identity or signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, conflicting, or replayed entry\"}},\"summary\":\"Verify raw Telegram initData and possession of separate delegate",
        " keys\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/environment\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Issuing-node only. Entries expire after ten minutes. Telegram identity is verified server-side; no owner private key or recovery passphrase is accepted. Status, cancel and bind require fresh one-use key proofs. Bind additionally requires an existing owner bearer and unchanged v6 owner/device transaction signatures.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Verified result\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed proof\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Identity or signature rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Expired, conflicting, or replayed entry\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the issuing node and production bot identity\"}},\"/api/v1/telegram/launch\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires an owner bearer or Telegram-linked delegate proof and a JSON body with app_id and init_data. Returns verified start_param, chat_type and purchase availability.\",\"responses\":{\"200\"",
        ":{\"description\":\"Verified launch\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid launch or account authentication\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Telegram app or linked buyer unavailable\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Launch already bound to a different app\"}},\"summary\":\"Verify raw Telegram Mini App launch data\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/activity\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"before_seq\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"limit\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Dew balance and newest-first activity events across every app\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"List the account's full Dew activity for the profile screen\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/assets\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token assets\"}},\"summary\":\"List token assets\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/balance\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\"",
        ":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token balance\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Invalid bearer token\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Get authenticated token balance\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/checkpoints/latest\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token checkpoint\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"No checkpoint exists\"}},\"summary\":\"Get latest signed token checkpoint\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/gifts\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires the account bearer. Moves units (integer millionths of Dew) from the caller to recipient, the account_id of an accepted friend. The sender's signed debit and the friend's signed credit commit together, with source_type gift and each other's account as source_ref. Preserve request_id on uncertain results: repeating it never sends twice and returns the first result even after the friendship ends; the same request_id with another recipi",
        "ent or amount is rejected. Returns the sender's balance after the gift.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"recipient\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"request_id\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":8,\"type\":\"string\"},\"units\":{\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"recipient\",\"units\",\"request_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Gift sent: request_id, recipient, units, balance and the debit receipt_id; no-store\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid recipient, amount or request ID, or a gift to oneself\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"402\":{\"description\":\"Not enough Dew\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"The recipient is not a friend\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Request ID reused for another recipient or amount\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Gifts unavailable; retain the request ID\"}},\"summary\":\"Send D",
        "ew to a friend\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/issuer\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token issuer\"}},\"summary\":\"Get token issuer key\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/ledger\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"since\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":false,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token ledger events\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"List authenticated token receipts\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/products\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Token products\"}},\"summary\":\"List configured token products\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/google/verify\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"If the app has token policies, this endpoint requires a purchase permission. X-Mesh-Tx is validated when present.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed credit receipt\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Verify app-s",
        "tore purchase and credit tokens\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/monero/address\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Permanent account payment address and conversion rate\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Get permanent Monero purchase address\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/monero/address/{recipient}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"recipient\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Resolved recipient and permanent payment address\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Recipient not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Get permanent Monero gift address\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/monero/deposits\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Detected and credited account deposits\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"List Monero deposits\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/monero/invoices\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"If the app has token policies, this endpoin",
        "t requires a purchase permission. X-Mesh-Tx is validated when present.\",\"responses\":{\"201\":{\"description\":\"Direct payment invoice\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Create direct token invoice\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/monero/invoices/{id}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Direct payment invoice status\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Invoice not found\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Get or settle direct token invoice\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/telegram/balance\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Current account, app, asset and signed integer wallet balance\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Telegram purchase permission required\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the linked purchaser's Dew balance\"}},\"/a",
        "pi/v1/tokens/purchases/telegram/catalog\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Enabled products with XTR and wallet-unit amounts\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"Telegram purchase permission required\"}},\"summary\":\"Read canonical Dew packs offered for Telegram Stars\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/telegram/invoices\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"Requires app_id, product_id, request_id and fresh init_data. Reuse request_id only for retries of the same product.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Existing invoice\"},\"201\":{\"description\":\"Created invoice\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Request ID terms conflict\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Creation retryable\"}},\"summary\":\"Create a buyer-bound XTR invoice link\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/telegram/invoices/{invoice_id}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"invoice_id\",\"re",
        "quired\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[a-f0-9]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Own invoice status and quote\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Invoice unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read the issuer's Stars settlement state\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/purchases/telegram/invoices/{invoice_id}/cancel\":{\"post\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"invoice_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"pattern\":\"^[a-f0-9]{32}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Current invoice status and quote\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Checkout already approved\"}},\"summary\":\"Cancel an unpaid Stars invoice before approval\"}},\"/api/v1/tokens/receipts/{receipt_id}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"receipt_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed token receipt\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Receipt not found\"}},\"summary\":\"Get token receipt\"}},\"/api/v1/token",
        "s/spend\":{\"post\":{\"description\":\"If the app has token policies, this endpoint requires the matching app asset permission. X-Mesh-Tx is validated when present.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed debit receipt\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Signed transaction required or rejected\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Insufficient balance\"}},\"security\":[{\"bearerAuth\":[]}],\"summary\":\"Spend tokens\"}},\"/api/v1/unlocks\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Account bearer required. Lists unlocks and current/regular prices in millionths of Dew. Island: 85000000 regular, 51000000 launch; trial_until is 0.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Account unlocks and current prices; no-store\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Unlocks unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"List the account's unlocks and the node's unlock prices\"},\"post\":{\"description\":\"Atomic node-priced debit and unlock. Paid pr",
        "oducts restore the original receipt without charging. Island requires exact expected_units; stale quotes return 409.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"expected_units\":{\"description\":\"Island only: confirmed current price_units.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"product\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"product\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Unlocked, with the charged price and current balance\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed request\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"402\":{\"description\":\"Insufficient balance\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Unknown product\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Price changed; fetch and confirm a fresh quote before purchase\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Unlocks unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Unlock a product with Dew at the node's price\"}},\"/api/v1/unlocks/grant\":{\"post\":{\"descriptio",
        "n\":\"Returns {grant,expires_at}: a one-hour Dew issuer-signed download grant for an owned product. Append the grant to the gated package URL.\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"properties\":{\"product\":{\"maxLength\":64,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"product\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Grant and expiry; no-store\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Malformed request\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"Account authentication required\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"The account has not unlocked this product\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Grants unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Get a one-hour download grant for an unlocked product\"}},\"/api/v1/unlocks/products\":{\"get\":{\"description\":\"Public current and regular product prices, as in GET /api/v1/unlocks.\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Current prices; no-store\"}},\"summary\":\"List the node's unlock prices\"}},\"/api/v2/pack",
        "ages/{app_id}/{asset}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"latest, history (up to three signed releases), or the release SHA-256 followed by .zx (.zib for releases built before the ZX format, .wasm for a WebAssembly variant)\",\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"For latest/history: the newest host interface the app runs; an older archived release is served when the latest needs a newer one\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"host_api\",\"schema\":{\"maximum\":65535,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"description\":\"For latest/history: the oldest host interface the app still runs; releases built for an older one are not offered\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"oldest_host_api\",\"schema\":{\"maximum\":65535,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"description\":\"For latest/history: the module interface the ap",
        "p requires\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"module_api\",\"schema\":{\"maximum\":65535,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"description\":\"For latest/history: the device's stable rollout bucket; a staged release reaches buckets below its share until it expires. Apps without a bucket count as 99\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"bucket\",\"schema\":{\"maximum\":99,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"description\":\"For latest/history: zx for hosts that run ZX portable executables, or wasm for web hosts that run the signed WebAssembly variant lowered from a .zx release. Without it only .zib releases for hosts from before the ZX format are offered\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"format\",\"schema\":{\"enum\":[\"zx\",\"wasm\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"For latest/history with format zx or wasm: the ZX executable revision the app runs; only releases whose .zx header has it are offered. Apps that name host_api without it run only revisions be",
        "fore 28\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"zx\",\"schema\":{\"maximum\":65535,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Signed release metadata or the portable bundle\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Invalid interface version, format or bucket\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"The artifact is gated; request it with a grant\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"App or release is unavailable, or no release fits the app\"}},\"summary\":\"Read an app's portable release for current hosts\"}},\"/api/v2/packages/{app_id}/{asset}/{grant}\":{\"get\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"app_id\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"The artifact SHA-256 followed by .zx (.zib for releases built before the ZX format, .wasm for a WebAssembly variant)\",\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"An unexpired grant from POST /api/v1/unlocks/grant for the artifact's produ",
        "ct. Artifacts that are not gated ignore it\",\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"grant\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"The portable bundle; private, no-store when gated\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"The artifact is gated and the grant is missing, expired, forged or for another product\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"App or artifact is unavailable\"}},\"summary\":\"Read a gated portable artifact with a download grant\"}},\"/healthz\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Server is healthy\"}},\"summary\":\"Health check\"}},\"/metrics\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Prometheus text metrics\"}},\"summary\":\"Prometheus metrics\"}},\"/readyz\":{\"get\":{\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Server is ready for production traffic\"},\"503\":{\"description\":\"Server is not ready\"}},\"summary\":\"Readiness check\"}}}}\n"
    ]
    return chunks
}
